2,"version":2327,"versionNonce":80699650,"isDeleted":false,"boundElements":[],"updated":1795461176886,"created":1795460901254,"link":null,"locked":false,"text":"Sell Pokemon button uses negative button. \nSells the next clicked pokemon using mouse or next selected pokemon with ENTER or\nSPACE on keyboard, notifies with toast that remains until a pokemon is selected. \nConfirmation dialog modal: \"Sell {name} for NN?\" \"Sell\"|\"Cancel\" default to cancel, Sell uses\nnegative button, cancel uses neutral.\nShift-Click converts to bulk sell:\nAllows highlighting of multiple pokemon. Then clicking Sell Pokemon again throws\nConfirmation Dialog: \"Sell selected pokemon for NN?\" \"Sell\"|\"Cancel\". \nClicking Sell brings a second dialog: \"Confirm\"|\"Cancel\" with no prompt. Shift click on initial\nbulk sell dialog skips second confirmation.","fontSize":17.151515151515113,"baseFontSize":19.151515151515113,"fontFamily":5,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","containerId":"mKo9l_RmqeOW7MLMcRllq","originalText":"Sell Pokemon button uses negative button. \nSells the next clicked pokemon using mouse or next selected pokemon with ENTER or SPACE on keyboard, notifies with toast that remains until a pokemon is selected. \nConfirmation dialog modal: \"Sell {name} for NN?\" \"Sell\"|\"Cancel\" default to cancel, Sell uses negative button, cancel uses neutral.\nShift-Click converts to bulk sell:\nAllows highlighting of multiple pokemon. Then clicking Sell Pokemon again throws Confirmation Dialog: \"Sell selected pokemon for NN?\" \"Sell\"|\"Cancel\". \nClicking Sell brings a second dialog: \"Confirm\"|\"Cancel\" with no prompt. Shift click on initial bulk sell dialog skips second confirmation.","autoResize":true,"lineHeight":1.25,"labelPosition":null},{"id":"qbBpuXUq9BqDH0ZItGjdK","type":"arrow","x":2159.5088898819026,"y":-2652.9408263480382,"width":382.98418626512739,"height":130.30134361426235,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#f08c00","backgroundColor":"#828282","fillStyle":"solid